Subject: host build: remove dependency copies Node never loads

Why: copyPackage nests every dependency under each dependent; the release had
~298k files (24 GB on fnOS ext4 with 64 KB clusters). After the full layout is
copied, nested copies whose nearest enclosing copy is the same source are
removed; every import resolves as before (checked edge by edge with
tools/release-resolution-check.mjs). Same code as the upstream PR.
Upstream: issue https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/issues/10406, PR https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/10419
Remove when: the PR is merged and upstream.lock moves past it.

